        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Winnie the Pooh (2011 film), Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book (1994 film)\n- People: Travis Oates, Jim Cummings, Jason Scott Lee, Stephen Sommers, Edward S. Feldman, Raju Patel, Ronald Yanover, Mark Geldman\n- Companies: Walt Disney Animation Studios, Walt Disney Pictures, Disney\n- Roles: Mowgli, Bruce Lee\n\nFacts:\n- Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book is a 1994 live-action American adventure film.\n- Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book was co-written and directed by Stephen Sommers.\n- Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book was produced by Edward S. Feldman and Raju Patel from a story by Ronald Yanover and Mark Geldman.\n- Jason Scott Lee played Mowgli in Disney's 1994 live-action adaptation of The Jungle Book.\n- Winnie the Pooh is a 2011 American animated buddy musical comedy film.\n- Winnie the Pooh was produced by Walt Disney Animation Studios and released by Walt Disney Pictures.\n- Travis Oates and Jim Cummings were the only two original voice actors to return for the 2011 Winnie the Pooh movie.\n- Jason Scott Lee is also known for playing Bruce Lee in a 1993 martial arts film.",
